                "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
                    {
                        "@value": "Is used to find the complete decomposed process of a process operatore. Note: This is syntactic sugar as a subprocess can be found by following \"isComposedOf\" and the inverse of \"consistsOf\"."
                    }
